{
  "id": "u11-l05",
  "unit": "u11-plans",
  "title": "When? Where? With whom?",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**Asking about plans.** Put the question word before the verb:\n\n- **কবে** 'when, on what day': **তুমি কবে আসবে?**\n- **কয়টায়** / **কখন** 'at what time': **কয়টায় আসবে?**\n- **কোথায়** 'where', **কী** 'what', **কার সাথে** 'with whom'\n\n**কালকের প্ল্যান কী?** 'What's the plan for tomorrow?' **প্ল্যান** is the English word, used everywhere in Bangladesh.\n\n**তোমাকে** is 'you' as an object (তুমি + -কে), like আমাকে and তাকে: **আমি তোমাকে ফোন করব** 'I'll call you', **তোমাকে পরে জানাব** 'I'll let you know later'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "kobe",
      "bn": "কবে",
      "tr": "kobe",
      "en": "when (on what day)",
      "notes": "Asks for the day or date; কখন / কয়টায় ask for the time."
    },
    {
      "id": "kar",
      "bn": "কার",
      "tr": "kar",
      "en": "whose",
      "notes": "কে 'who' + -র. কার সাথে 'with whom' (literally 'whose with')."
    },
    {
      "id": "tomake",
      "bn": "তোমাকে",
      "tr": "tomake",
      "en": "you (familiar, object)",
      "notes": "তুমি + -কে, like আমাকে, তাকে, আপনাকে."
    },
    {
      "id": "janabo",
      "bn": "জানাব",
      "tr": "janabo",
      "en": "I will let (you) know",
      "notes": "Future of জানানো 'let know, inform'. Also spelled জানাবো."
    },
    {
      "id": "plyan",
      "bn": "প্ল্যান",
      "tr": "plyan",
      "en": "plan",
      "notes": "The English word, used everywhere in Bangladesh: কালকের প্ল্যান কী?"
    },
    {
      "id": "kalker",
      "bn": "কালকের",
      "tr": "kalker",
      "en": "tomorrow's",
      "notes": "কাল + -এর. Like কাল, it can also mean 'yesterday's'."
    }
  ],
